<p>岐阜県のキャンプ場「八滝ウッディランド」はゴールデンウィークも絶賛営業中。</p>
<p><img alt="" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-421" height="768" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" src="/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234550.jpg" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234550.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234550-300x225.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234550-768x576.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234550-830x623.jpg 830w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234550-230x173.jpg 230w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234550-350x263.jpg 350w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234550-480x360.jpg 480w" width="1024"/></p>
<p>テントが沢山並び、子供連れの家族連れで賑わいます。スタッフも大忙し。</p>
<p><img alt="" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-420" height="768" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" src="/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234518.jpg" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234518.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234518-300x225.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234518-768x576.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234518-830x623.jpg 830w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234518-230x173.jpg 230w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234518-350x263.jpg 350w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234518-480x360.jpg 480w" width="1024"/></p>
<p>駐車スペースまでいっぱいです。</p>
<p><img alt="" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-422" height="768" loading="lazy" sizes="(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" src="/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234620.jpg" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234620.jpg 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234620-300x225.jpg 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234620-768x576.jpg 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234620-830x623.jpg 830w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234620-230x173.jpg 230w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234620-350x263.jpg 350w, /wp-content/uploads/2017/05/20170504234620-480x360.jpg 480w" width="1024"/></p>
<p>魚のつかみ取りも大好評。たくさんの子供達、大人たちが魚を追いかけていました。</p>
<p>ゴールデンウィークにはぜひ岐阜県のキャンプ場「八滝ウッディランド」でバーベキューやテント泊、バンガロー泊を楽しんでみてはいかがでしょうか？</p>
